{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112049","id":2948417200,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vvUaw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112049","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112049.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112049.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112049","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112049/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112049/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112049/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/49bffd171a458ba96fbe833662e6d7f41aa905b9","number":112049,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix TileMapLayer over-generalizing constraints causing problems #112025","user":{"login":"IphStich","id":5625804,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjU4MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5625804?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich","html_url":"https://github.com/IphStich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #112025\r\n\r\nThe `TileMapLayer` constraint system was over-generalizing, forcing corners to apply terrain to un-intended cells.\r\n\r\nIt will now flag corners and edges as non-painting, causing the logic to obtain the correct terrain for the cell **opposite** the constraining edge/corner (rather than assuming the value of the corner/edge applies to all concerned cells).\r\n\r\n> The peering bits determine which tile will be placed depending on neighboring tiles.\r\n[docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/2d/using_tilesets.html#doc-using-tilesets-creating-terrain-sets)\r\n\r\nThis was causing problems anytime multiple Terrains were used.\r\n\r\n(I haven't checked if this solves any other issues, will search tomorrow)","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-26T12:03:12Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T10:14:19Z","closed_at":"2025-10-27T02:51:40Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4ec24713ff29edb799254e521cdc72a5d67d3e66","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"IphStich:fix-112025","ref":"fix-112025","repo":{"id":977497337,"node_id":"R_kgDOOkNs-Q","name":"godot","full_name":"IphStich/godot","owner":{"login":"IphStich","id":5625804,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjU4MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5625804?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich","html_url":"https://github.com/IphStich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/subscriptions","or